From b9f76b6a52bbf9c190635d88d7b7d4f64a4a368b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:04:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat(post): emit Agie straight cutoffs with separate air
 endpoints

Check the retained wall, kerf side, air approaches and centered XY travel. Require the operator to clamp both pieces through all QN2 passes. Keep closed work on its existing nominal cycle.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2962
